#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/gen2.asn
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	sites
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Concise
#Data requested:	Domain hits and site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: NO
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#DOMAINS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<hit-type>	<PSSM-ID>	<from>	<to>	<E-Value>	<bitscore>	<accession>	<short-name>	<incomplete>	<superfamily PSSM-ID>
#more such lines......
#ENDDOMAINS
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	97	NP_416215.1 ferredoxin-like protein YdiT [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_1	Non-specific	511035	7	97	1.0539e-48	149.691	NF011993	PRK15449	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
SITES
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	77	NP_415978.1 tautomerase PptA [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_2	Specific	503367	1	75	3.68879e-41	129.123	NF002324	PRK01271	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
SITES
1	Query_2	Specific	dimer interface	P2,H3,I4,D5,I6,K7,C8,L21,D24,I25,V28,H32,L33	13	13	238274
1	Query_2	Specific	active site 1	P2,H3,S39	3	3	238274
1	Query_2	Specific	active site 2	K7,W52	2	2	238274
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
